  - name: Header -HIERARCHY
    heading: HIERARCHY
    text: '3D -> place your model in the "model"''s folder


      2D -> You have
      images , create a folder inside the 2D folder with the name of your image and
      place your work inside.


      LIGHTING - > Only Lighting prefab are inside


      VFX
      -> Special effect folder , there is prefab or material that comes from shaders

'
